{"unit_id":"raomaiping-hash__dsh-client-ui-mobile#card-zh","repo":"raomaiping-hash/dsh-client-ui-mobile","commit":"ee1dd08b6856358fe7897dda6622bb5b01b159d9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-mobile 面向需要在手机或小平板上使用 DSH Web 的用户，调整小屏下的主界面布局。它会把左侧导航收纳为可展开的抽屉，在会话页提供顶栏按钮、在首页提供悬浮入口；设置对话框变为带横向分区标签的全屏面板；右侧栏变为从底部滑出的面板。插件还为小屏补上安全区留白、触屏操作尺寸和减少动态效果偏好支持。通过 DSH Web profile 安装后，进入窄屏界面即可自动适配，不需要 API Key 或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:90-125","client.js:241-320","client.js:535-646"]}
{"unit_id":"raomaiping-hash__dsh-client-ui-mobile#card-en","repo":"raomaiping-hash/dsh-client-ui-mobile","commit":"ee1dd08b6856358fe7897dda6622bb5b01b159d9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-client-ui-mobile adapts DSH Web for phone and small-tablet screens. It turns the sidebar into a drawer, makes settings a full-screen panel with scrollable tabs, and docks the right sidebar as a bottom sheet. It also adjusts safe areas and touch controls.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:90-125","client.js:241-320","client.js:535-646"]}
